rows.abstract:
Proposes for the expansion of the list of drugs and medicines that are subject to price regulation, which shall include, inter alia: 
(A)  All drugs and medicines indicated for treatment of chronic illnesses and life threatening conditions, such as, . . . RHEUMATOID ARTHRITIES; . . .
(F) ALL DRUGS AND MEDICINES INDICATED FOR TREATMENT OF . . . COMMON COLD, COUGH, BODY PAIN, MIGRAINE, AND DIARRHEA;
(G) VITAMINS AND MINERAL SUPPLEMENTS . . . VITAMIN C, VITAMIN E, IRON SUPPLEMENT, FOLIC ACID;
(H) ALL DRUGS AND MEDICINES INDICATED FOR EPIDEMICS AND SEASONAL ILLNESSES, . . . DENGUE, CORNAVIRUS, LEPTOSPIROSIS; . . .
